# The shop's web server and its neighbours, on one switch.
#
#   office    10.0.9.2    a customer's laptop
#   web       10.0.9.1    nginx: api.shop.test, the partners' API
#   partner   10.0.9.3    the warehouse's server, a partner of the shop
#   resolver  10.0.9.53   the shop's name server (Unbound)
#
# Every machine asks the resolver for names.
machine office
machine web
machine partner
machine resolver

lan shopnet office:eth0=10.0.9.2/24 web:eth0=10.0.9.1/24 partner:eth0=10.0.9.3/24 resolver:eth0=10.0.9.53/24

dns office 10.0.9.53
dns web 10.0.9.53
dns partner 10.0.9.53

run resolver unbound
run web nginx
